<ResearchLayout title="Glass Core｜J 的世界 Research" page="P5">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="page-kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P5</div>
  <div class="page-meta"><span>SIGNAL <b>Glass Core</b></span><span>EVIDENCE <b>FACTS FIRST</b></span><span>FOCUS <b>AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</b></span></div>
  <h1 class="page-title">Glass Core：結果，而不是起點</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Advanced Packaging → AI Accelerator</p>
  <div class="editorial-rule"></div>
  <div class="lead-grid">
    <div class="lead-visual"><div class="visual-label">GLASS CORE EVOLUTION</div><div class="visual-stack"><div class="bar">GLASS</div><div class="bar">TGV</div><div class="bar">CORE SUBSTRATE</div><div class="bar">ADVANCED PACKAGING</div><div class="bar">AI ACCELERATOR</div></div><div class="visual-big">GLASS<br><em>CORE</em></div></div><aside class="lead-note"><span class="tag">GLASS CORE</span><h2>Glass Core 不應被單獨理解成一項材料題材。</h2><p>它應放在 AI 封裝持續提高尺寸、密度與訊號完整性的背景下觀察；真正重要的是驗證、製程整合、良率、量產時間與客戶導入。</p></aside>
  </div>
  <div class="j-insight"><span class="insight-label">J 的解讀 · WHY GLASS CORE MATTERS</span><h3>不要只問「玻璃基板會不會成為下一個題材」，先問它解決了什麼問題。</h3><p>當 AI 封裝往更大尺寸、更高密度與更嚴格的訊號完整性要求前進，Glass Core 的價值要放在整條鏈上看：Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Advanced Packaging → AI Accelerator。真正的驗證點，是製程整合、良率、量產與客戶導入。</p><small>本頁延續 Vol.01 的 Evidence First 原則；不把產業期待當成已確認量產事實。</small></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">POSITION</div><h2>先看它在系統裡的位置</h2></div></div><div class="flow"><div class="flow-node"><b>Glass</b><span>材料基礎</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>TGV</b><span>垂直互連</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Core Substrate</b><span>核心載體</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>Advanced Packaging</b><span>封裝整合</span></div><div class="flow-node"><b>AI Accelerator</b><span>系統應用</span></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRACKING</div><h2>真正值得追蹤的五件事</h2></div></div><div class="editorial-grid three"><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">01</div><h3>技術驗證</h3><p>是否由研發概念進入實際驗證。</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">02</div><h3>製程整合</h3><p>能否與既有封裝流程協同工作。</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">03</div><h3>良率</h3><p>是否跨過大規模生產的門檻。</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">04</div><h3>量產時間</h3><p>從驗證到量產的時間軸。</p></article><article class="editorial-card gold"><div class="num">05</div><h3>客戶導入</h3><p>是否從單一案例走向平台化採用。</p></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">→</div><h3>Evidence First</h3><p>不要只以市場題材判斷。</p></article></div></section>
  
</div>
</ResearchLayout>
